{"id":"1932406214786015357","kind":"answer","title":"北上广的「学术酒吧」火了，年轻人为何爱在酒吧聊学术？参加「学术酒吧」能获得什么？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"Gwern Branwen","date":"2025-07-26","updated":"2025-07-26","votes":66,"comment_count":2,"minutes":1,"chars":645,"keywords":["场域群智","小团体协作","社会资本","同伴学习","创新"],"summary":"前排看了一圈，居然没人提 利沃夫学派（Lwów School） 的 苏格兰书（Scottish Book） 与 酒馆（Scottish Café） （ Café 也卖酒的！）。 我简单翻译一下 Wikipedia 上的介绍： Scottish Café （ 波兰语 ： Kawiarnia Szkocka ）曾是 波兰第二共和国…","question_detail_html":"<p>今年以来，“学术酒吧”活动在上海、北京、广州等多个大城市兴起。</p><p>主讲人多是人文社科领域的博士或青年学者，带来自己的研究成果与大家分享，观众多是大学生或参加工作的年轻人。在酒吧这个更为放松的环境中，大家学习知识，也彼此交流。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-a46aea7ff4af421f8dc4e34cff7e7d6a_r.jpg\" width=\"912\"/></figure><p>类似的学术交流和文化沙龙活动，在学校讲堂、咖啡厅或书店中并不新鲜，但当它与酒吧相遇，产生了奇妙的碰撞。</p><p>学术酒吧，谁在办，谁来讲，谁在听？大家想通过参加学术酒吧活动获得什么？学术酒吧是昙花一现，还是会发展成为我们文化生活的一部分？</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/666541481/answer/1932406214786015357","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"相关文章"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"XW3wrX0m\">前排看了一圈，居然没人提<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lwów_School_of_Mathematics\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">利沃夫学派（Lwów School）</a>的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scottish_Book\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">苏格兰书（Scottish Book）</a>与<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scottish_Café\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">酒馆（Scottish Café）</a>（<span class=\"nolink\">Café</span> 也卖酒的！）。</p><p data-pid=\"jRQTvPSZ\">我简单翻译一下 Wikipedia 上的介绍：</p><p data-pid=\"sRr-jhTT\"><span class=\"nolink\">Scottish Café</span>（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Polish_language\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">波兰语</a>：<i>Kawiarnia Szkocka</i>）曾是<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Second_Polish_Republic\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">波兰第二共和国</a><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lviv\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">利沃夫</a>（今<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ukraine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">乌克兰</a>利沃夫市）的一家 Café。在 1930 至 1940 年代，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lwów_School_of_Mathematics\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">利沃夫数学学派</a>的数学家们常聚集于此，切磋琢磨<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mathematical_problem\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">数学难题</a>，尤其是在<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Functional_analysis\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">泛函分析</a>和<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/General_topology\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">拓扑学</a>领域。</p><p data-pid=\"tYPwr8oz\">据<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stanisław_Ulam\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">斯坦尼斯瓦夫·乌拉姆</a>回忆，Café 的桌面是<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marble\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">大理石</a>的，所以他们在讨论时，可以用铅笔直接在桌上书写。为了不让这些研究成果付诸东流，也因为对他们直接在桌上乱涂乱画感到恼火，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stefan_Banach\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">斯特凡·巴拿赫</a>的妻子为数学家们提供了一本大笔记本，用于记录问题和答案，这本笔记最终便以《<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scottish_Book\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">苏格兰书</a>》而闻名。书中收集了已解、未解、甚至可能无解的各种问题，Café 的任何客人都可以借阅。解答任何问题都有奖励，而那些最艰深、最具挑战性的难题，其彩头也尤为贵重（时值<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Depression\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">大萧条</a>末期与<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_War_II\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">二战</a>前夕），例如一瓶上等的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brandy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">白兰地</a>。</p><p data-pid=\"THVxYUaE\">对于第 153 号问题，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stanisław_Mazur\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">斯坦尼斯瓦夫·马祖尔</a>开出的奖品是一只活鹅，该问题后来被公认为与斯特凡·巴拿赫的「<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Approximation_problem\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">基问题</a>」密切相关。此题直到 1972 年才由<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Per_Enflo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">皮尔·恩弗洛</a>解出，在一个全波兰转播的颁奖仪式上，他领走了这只活鹅作为奖品。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-3d144af66f84d72c7a54c851d5e8f538_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-f8038999bc74da6a7d9db604255b2bdf\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-f8038999bc74da6a7d9db604255b2bdf_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1600\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-3d144af66f84d72c7a54c851d5e8f538_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-f8038999bc74da6a7d9db604255b2bdf\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-f8038999bc74da6a7d9db604255b2bdf_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1600\"/></figure><h2 id=\"sec-1\">相关文章</h2><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"20351832676\" href=\"#/post/20351832676\">非常规小团体的惊人效能</a><p></p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"20351832676","title":"非常规小团体的惊人效能","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":83,"minutes":8,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"1939651753281823043","title":"英文互联网搜索技巧","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":287,"minutes":62,"reason":"延伸深读 · Gwern Branwen"},{"id":"15504680631","title":"创新的起源：Bakewell 与育种技术","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":22,"minutes":28,"reason":"延伸深读 · Gwern Branwen"},{"id":"1955580086083364669","title":"速通，真的没那么浪费天赋","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":225,"minutes":10,"reason":"延伸深读 · Gwern Branwen"},{"id":"12885434865","title":"技术圣战实为协调难题","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":25,"minutes":21,"reason":"延伸深读 · Gwern Branwen"},{"id":"2094799990279370013","title":"你的电脑里有多少台电脑？","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":36,"minutes":13,"reason":"延伸深读 · Gwern Branwen"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"1941913208832098371","title":"你有什么在网上搜索东西的神搜索技巧？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":577,"minutes":65,"reason":"相似问答 · 577 赞同"},{"id":"89422556482","title":"有哪些好玩的科学家趣事？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":75,"minutes":6,"reason":"相似问答 · 75 赞同"},{"id":"59948214835","title":"为何网上充斥着程序员们各种“主义”之争？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":49,"minutes":21,"reason":"相似问答 · 49 赞同"},{"id":"1930921028105769969","title":"高智商的人会越容易精神出问题吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":111,"minutes":4,"reason":"相似问答 · 111 赞同"},{"id":"2040859734807402486","title":"为什么强化学习那么杂，如何理清其中的思路？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":53,"minutes":30,"reason":"相似问答 · 53 赞同"}]}